@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam monochrome true

node "Client Browser" {
    [Web SPA] as SPA
}

node "Application Server" {
    [ASP.NET Core API] as API
    database "In-Memory Database" as DB
}

cloud "External Services" {
    [Identity Provider] as IDP
    [Email Service] as Email
}

SPA --> API : HTTPS/REST
API --> DB : EF Core ORM
API --> IDP : OAuth 2.0
API --> Email : SMTP

note right of API
  Single deployment unit
  containing all business logic,
  API endpoints, and data access
end note

@enduml